\ cvtpub ( -- pub )   the public tuples: one, multiplicity -1, the octet [10, 0...].
: cvtpub ( -- pub )
	cvpbv @ 0= if
		30 lit alloc dup cvpbv ! B lit zero
		1 lit cvpbv @ !  2013265920u lit cvpbv @ 4 lit + !  9 lit cvpbv @ 8 lit + !
